---
import Feature from "./Feature.astro";
import Pip from "./Pip.astro";
import Mark from "./Mark.astro";
const quests = [["Earn 20 XP", 100], ["Complete 2 lessons", 50], ["Get 10 in a row correct", 70]] as const;
const path = [0, 48, 72, 48, 0];
const code = `"vars": {
  "AI_BASE_URL": "https://inference.celeris.ai/celeris-1/v1",
  "AI_MODEL": "celeris-1"
}`;
const local = `AI_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
AI_MODEL=llama3.3`;
---
<Feature id="feature-lessons" eyebrow="bite-sized" title="Lessons written for your level">
  <p>Tell Pip what you know and how much time you have. Each lesson is a handful of quick exercises: pick the meaning, build the sentence, match the pairs, type the answer.</p>
  <p class="mt-3">Get one wrong and it comes back at the end, with a short “why” whenever you ask.</p>
  <div slot="art" class="card p-5" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-2xl font-black text-muted">×</span>
      <div class="bar flex-1"><span style="width:60%"></span></div>
      <span class="font-extrabold text-bad-ink">♥ 5</span>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg font-extrabold">Translate this sentence</p>
    <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-3">
      <Pip size={64} />
      <div class="bubble text-base">I drink water</div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 flex min-h-12 flex-wrap gap-2 border-y-2 border-line py-2">
      <span class="tile">Yo</span><span class="tile">bebo</span>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2">
      <span class="tile text-transparent opacity-50">Yo</span><span class="tile text-transparent opacity-50">bebo</span><span class="tile">agua</span><span class="tile">leche</span><span class="tile">como</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</Feature>

<Feature id="feature-habit" eyebrow="stay motivated" title="Streaks, hearts and daily quests" flip>
  <p>A streak grows every day you learn. Hearts keep you careful, XP keeps score, and three small quests a day give you a reason to come back.</p>
  <p class="mt-3">Pick a streak goal and Pip will cheer you all the way there.</p>
  <div slot="art" class="card p-5" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-around text-2xl font-black">
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-coral-ink"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-8"><path d="M12 2c1 4 6 6 6 12a6 6 0 0 1-12 0c0-3 2-5 3-6 0 2 1 3 2 3 0-3-1-6 1-9z" fill="var(--os-coral)"></path><path d="M12 12c1 2 3 3 3 5a3 3 0 0 1-6 0c0-1 1-2 1-3 1 1 2 0 2-2z" fill="var(--os-sun)"></path></svg>14</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-8"><path d="M13 2 4 14h7l-1 8 9-12h-7z" fill="var(--os-sun)"></path></svg>320</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-bad-ink"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-8"><path d="M12 21s-8-5-8-11a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 8-3 4.5 4.5 0 0 1 8 3c0 6-8 11-8 11z" fill="var(--os-heart)"></path></svg>5</span>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-6 font-extrabold">Daily quests</p>
    <ul class="mt-3 grid gap-4">
      {quests.map(([label, pct]) => (
        <li>
          <p class="font-bold">{label}</p>
          <div class="bar mt-1.5"><span style={`width:${pct}%;background:var(--os-sun)`}></span></div>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </div>
</Feature>

<Feature id="feature-anything" eyebrow="any subject" title="Languages, math, or anything you type">
  <p>Sixteen languages and math are one tap away. Or type a topic, like chess openings, music theory or Python, and Pip lays out a whole course of units for it.</p>
  <p class="mt-3">Finish every unit and Pip writes the next ones.</p>
  <div slot="art" class="card relative overflow-hidden p-5" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border-b-4 px-4 py-3 text-white" style="background:oklch(0.52 0.09 187);border-color:oklch(0.42 0.09 187)">
      <p class="text-xs font-extrabold tracking-wide uppercase">Unit 1</p>
      <p class="text-lg font-extrabold">Opening principles</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="mt-6 flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
      {path.map((x, i) => (
        <li style={`transform:translateX(${x}px)`}>
          <span class:list={["grid size-14 place-items-center rounded-full border-b-[5px] text-xl font-black", i <= 2 ? "border-[var(--os-sea-edge)] bg-sea text-on-sea" : "border-line bg-locked text-muted", i === 2 && "ring-8 ring-sea-wash"]}>{i < 2 ? "✓" : i === 2 ? "★" : i + 1}</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
    <Pip size={90} class="absolute bottom-8 left-4" />
    <span class="absolute top-28 right-5"><Mark hue={280} mark="♞" size={44} /></span>
  </div>
</Feature>

<Feature id="feature-open" eyebrow="open source" title="Bring your own model" flip>
  <p>Otterspeak is MIT licensed. It talks to any OpenAI-compatible API: Celeris by default, or Ollama, vLLM, Together, OpenRouter and the rest. Change two lines and deploy it on Cloudflare.</p>
  <p class="mt-3">Your progress stays on your device. No account needed.</p>
  <div slot="art" class="card overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
    <p class="border-b-2 border-line px-4 py-2 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-muted">wrangler.json</p>
    <pre class="p-4 font-mono text-[13px] leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-wrap break-all text-sea-ink">{code}</pre>
    <p class="border-y-2 border-line px-4 py-2 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-muted">.dev.vars, with Ollama</p>
    <pre class="p-4 font-mono text-[13px] leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-wrap break-all text-coral-ink">{local}</pre>
  </div>
</Feature>
